euthydemus-perish.logic.r3: argue/equivocates: P5 (S9): it takes "be" from predicative: no longer to be what he is (ignorant) to existential: no longer to exist, to perish, a reader says: the argument holds only through it; without it, C2 (S9) does not follow (euthydemus-perish.logic.r3.sense1)
